                "description": "The Brussels Lever with Rectangular Rose has concealed mounting and will fit 1-3/8 - 1-3/4 inch thick doors with standard backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is made out of stainless steel and available in either polished stainless steel or satin stainless steel finishes. The Stainless Steel Brussels Lever with SH Rose features a curved design that emphasizes its modern appeal. \r\n",
